Announcing the June 2007 nethack.alt.org Tournament!

Visit http://sartak.katron.org/nh/07/ and especially
http://sartak.katron.org/nh/07/faq.html for the full low-down.

New stuff this year:
* Clans
* Per-player, per-trophy, and per-clan pages!
* New trophies:
  + Truest Pacifist Ascension (fewest kills)
  + Most Extinctionist Ascension (most kills)
  + Clan: Best in Show (hey, it's new to June!)
  + Clan: Most Ascensions
  + Clan: Highest Ascension Ratio

To participate all you have to do is play on the nethack.alt.org
server any time during June. Only games fully within June count. This
means your game must start at or after 00:00:00 (UTC) June 1st and end
before or at 23:59:59 (UTC) June 30th.

